<rss version="0.92"><channel><item>
            <title>[LU-21256] MDS LBUG in lod_prep_lmv_md() (ASSERTION(lo-&gt;ldo_dir_striped != 0)) when running lfs migrate -m with multi-stripe count on a single-MDT filesystem</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-21256</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Running &lt;b&gt;&lt;tt&gt;lfs migrate -m 0 -c 2 &amp;lt;dir&amp;gt;&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/b&gt; (or any migration requesting &lt;tt&gt;stripe_count &amp;gt; max_stripe_count&lt;/tt&gt;, such as &lt;tt&gt;-c 2&lt;/tt&gt; without &lt;tt&gt;-C&lt;/tt&gt; or &lt;tt&gt;-C 2&lt;/tt&gt; when &lt;tt&gt;lod_max_stripes_per_mdt=1&lt;/tt&gt;, on a single-MDT filesystem) causes an immediate &lt;tt&gt;LBUG&lt;/tt&gt; kernel panic on the MDS inside &lt;tt&gt;lod_prep_lmv_md()&lt;/tt&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;LustreError: ...:(lod_object.c:...:lod_prep_lmv_md()) ASSERTION( lo-&amp;gt;ldo_dir_striped != 0 ) failed:&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Call path on the MDS:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;lod_prep_lmv_md
 -&amp;gt; lod_xattr_set_lmv
 -&amp;gt; lod_dir_striping_create_internal
 -&amp;gt; lod_xattr_set
 -&amp;gt; mdo_xattr_set
 -&amp;gt; mdd_create_object
 -&amp;gt; mdd_migrate_create
 -&amp;gt; mdd_migrate_object
 -&amp;gt; mdd_migrate
 -&amp;gt; mdt_reint_migrate&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Steps to Reproduce&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;



&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Mount a Lustre filesystem with a single MDT (MDSCOUNT=1)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Create a directory with a file inside it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;mkdir /mnt/lustre/testdir touch /mnt/lustre/testdir/file&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt; &lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Run &lt;b&gt;&lt;tt&gt;lfs migrate&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/b&gt; requesting 2 metadata stripes:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;lfs migrate -m 0 -c 2 /mnt/lustre/testdir&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</description>
